# Project Structure & Architecture Guide

## Overview
Conduit UI is a Next.js 16 admin panel for the Conduit Platform with React Server Components, built with TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and shadcn/ui components.

## Directory Structure

### Core Application Structure
- [src/app](mdc:src/app) - Next.js App Router pages and layouts
  - [src/app/(dashboard)](mdc:src/app/(dashboard)) - Dashboard layout group
  - [src/app/(dashboard)/(modules)](mdc:src/app/(dashboard)/(modules)) - Module-specific pages
  - [src/app/login](mdc:src/app/login) - Authentication pages
- [src/components](mdc:src/components) - Reusable React components organized by feature
- [src/lib](mdc:src/lib) - Utility functions, API clients, and business logic
- [src/contexts](mdc:src/contexts) - React context providers
- [src/types](mdc:src/types) - TypeScript type definitions

### Module Organization
Each module follows a consistent structure under `src/components/[module-name]/`:
- Dashboard components
- Feature-specific components (users, settings, etc.)
- Form components
- Table components
- Dialog/modal components

### Key Configuration Files
- [package.json](mdc:package.json) - Dependencies and scripts (Node.js 24+ required)
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) - TypeScript configuration with path mapping
- [tailwind.config.js](mdc:tailwind.config.js) - Tailwind CSS with custom design system
- [next.config.ts](mdc:next.config.ts) - Next.js configuration (env from `.env*` files, loaded by Next)
- [components.json](mdc:components.json) - shadcn/ui component configuration

## Architecture Patterns

### Component Architecture
- Use React Server Components for data fetching where possible
- Client components marked with 'use client' directive
- Custom UI components extend shadcn/ui base components
- Form components use react-hook-form with Zod validation

### API Layer
- [src/lib/api/api.ts](mdc:src/lib/api/api.ts) - Central API client with axios
- Module-specific API functions in `src/lib/api/[module]/`
- Server actions marked with 'use server' directive
- Environment-aware API client with cookie-based auth

### State Management
- React Context for global state ([src/contexts](mdc:src/contexts))
- React Hook Form for form state
- URL state for navigation and filters
- Server state via API calls

### Styling System
- Tailwind CSS with custom design tokens
- CSS variables for theming (light/dark mode support)
- Component variants using class-variance-authority (cva)
- Consistent spacing and typography scale

## Module Pattern
Each Conduit module (Authentication, Database, Email, etc.) follows:
1. Main dashboard page at `/[module]`
2. Feature pages at `/[module]/[feature]`
3. Settings page at `/[module]/settings`
4. Components organized in `src/components/[module]/`
5. API functions in `src/lib/api/[module]/`
6. Type definitions in `src/lib/models/[module]/`

## Navigation Structure
- Sidebar navigation defined in [src/components/navigation/navList.config.ts](mdc:src/components/navigation/navList.config.ts)
- Module-based routing with consistent URL patterns
- Breadcrumb navigation for deep pages
- Environment switching capability